<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Jesus has saved me, wonderful Savior!</l><l>Jesus has saved me, I cannot tell how;</l><l>All that I know is He was my ransom,</l><l>Dying on Calv’ry with thorns on His brow.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Jesus will lead me, wonderful Savior!</l><l>Jesus will lead me, I cannot tell where;</l><l>But I will follow, through joy or sorrow,</l><l>Sunshine or tempest, sweet peace or despair.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Jesus will crown me, wonderful Savior!</l><l>Jesus will crown me, I cannot tell when;</l><l>His throne of splendor hail I with gladness,</l><l>Crowned with the glory of God among men.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
